  "final_message": "I have started checking the git status and will inspect the codebase once complete.\nI am listing all files in the repository to understand where events are referenced.\nI am waiting for the file list command to complete.\nI am checking all references to `OrderPlaced` in the codebase.\nI am checking the git log for context on past event changes.\nI am waiting for the commit history command to finish.\nI am running the test suite to establish a clean baseline.\nI am checking the full git log history to see past deprecation patterns.\nI am waiting for the git history output.\nI am searching for any existing deprecation annotations or patterns.\nI am waiting for the deprecation search command to finish.\nI am running the architecture check to ensure dependency cruiser rules are satisfied.\nI am waiting for the architecture check to complete.\nI am waiting for `depcruise` to complete.\nI am running the test suite to verify the changes.\nI am waiting for the tests to finish running.\nI am running `npm run typecheck` to verify strict TypeScript types.\nI am waiting for the typecheck command to complete.\nI am waiting for git diff to review all modifications.\nI am running the architecture rule checks.\nI am waiting for `depcruise` to complete.\nIn accordance with the architecture rules (specifically **ARCH-4**, which requires changes to events consumed by external services to be additive and go through deprecation), [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L30) has been updated to align with the Payments and Customer APIs:\n\n1. **[`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts)**:\n   - Added `amountCents: number` and `createdAt: string` to the [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L30) interface.\n   - Retained `totalCents` and `placedAt` with `@deprecated` annotations so existing deployed consumers (`billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`) remain unbroken.\n   - Updated [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L46-L68) to populate both the new names (`amountCents`, `createdAt`) and the deprecated fields (`totalCents`, `placedAt`).\n\n2. **Tests**:\n   - Updated [`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/app.test.ts#L21-L32) and [`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/adapters.test.ts#L47-L55) to verify `amountCents` and `createdAt` on published events while asserting backward compatibility.\n\nAll unit tests (`npm test`), TypeScript checks (`npm run typecheck`), and architecture dependency rules (`npm run arch`) pass.\nThe checks have finished successfully and the changes are complete.\n",
